+
+## Intent
+
+**Problem:** The SSR no-JS fallback of `/apply/:code` renders its only submit button with a hard-coded `disabled` attribute (`review_consent.gleam`), so an applicant with JavaScript disabled can never submit — violating the spec's progressive-enhancement requirement (found by the #564 post-merge audit). Separately, post-#564 migration debris: `.pi/skills/form-bug-hunt/helpers/generate-fixtures.sh` does `cd "$(dirname "$0")/fixtures"` with no `mkdir -p`, so it aborts (`set -e`) on any checkout where `fixtures/` doesn't exist — re-breaking bug-hunt preflight at the new `.pi/skills` path.
+
+**Approach:** Invert the enhancement direction: SSR renders the submit button ENABLED (no-JS posts out of the box); with JS on, form.js's existing consent gate already disables it on init via `data-consent-blocked` + `__rtRecomputeSubmitDisabled()` — no JS changes needed. Add the one-line `mkdir -p` to the fixtures script.
+
+## Boundaries & Constraints
+
+**Always:**
+- Server-side validation stays the authoritative gate: `gdpr_consent`, `reference_attestation.validate_choice` (RC1.2), timing (`is_timing_suspicious`, fail-closed), honeypot — all unchanged.
+- JS gating behavior unchanged: form.js's consent/preflight gates still disable the button on init and on change when JS runs.
+- DOM hooks preserved exactly: `data-testid="submit-application"`, `id=gdpr-consent`, `name=gdpr_consent`, all existing testids.
+- No-JS anti-spam still works: server-rendered `_form_loaded_at` epoch ms is untouched (scripted no-JS submits must sleep > 2 s).
+
+**Ask First:** any change to validation logic, consent copy, or the JS gate protocol.
+
+**Never:**
+- No edits to form.js / form_stepper.js / other static assets (no `.gitignore` whitelist changes needed).
+- No relaxing of consent/attestation/timing enforcement to make the no-JS path pass.
+- No merging the PR.
+
+## I/O & Edge-Case Matrix
+
+| Scenario | Input / State | Expected Output / Behavior | Error Handling |
+|----------|--------------|---------------------------|----------------|
+| No-JS valid submit | JS disabled; full valid form incl. attestation radio + consent ticked; >2 s dwell | POST accepted → `confirmation-page`; application persists | N/A |
+| No-JS consent unticked | JS disabled; valid form, consent unticked | Server re-render with `error-summary` + consent error; nothing persisted | Server-side rejection |
+| No-JS invalid fields | JS disabled; required fields missing | Server-side `error-summary` re-render listing fields | Server-side rejection |
+| JS enabled, long form | JS on, `?stepper=off` | Submit starts disabled (consent gate init); ticking consent enables; valid submit → confirmation | Unticked submit never leaves browser; server rejects if forced |
+| JS enabled, stepper | JS on, stepped layout | Step gating (Continue blocks on empty required) and final submit unregressed | N/A |
+| Fixtures, fresh checkout | `fixtures/` absent | Script creates dir and generates all fixtures, exits 0 | N/A |
+
