+- `rm -rf .pi/skills/form-bug-hunt/helpers/fixtures && bash .pi/skills/form-bug-hunt/helpers/generate-fixtures.sh` — expected: exit 0, fixtures listed.
+- Real browser, JS disabled (agent-browser/Chromium with JavaScript off) against local `make dev` on the docker test DB — expected: enabled submit; valid submit → confirmation + persisted row; invalid → server error re-render.
+- Real browser, JS enabled — expected: stepper gating + consent gate + final submit unregressed.
+
+**Manual checks (if no CLI):**
+- Inspect serialized SSR (`gleam run -m …` test output or curl of local `/apply/:code`): submit button tag has no `disabled`.
